20:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Oxford: an actual MBA route still has eligibility conditions",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Oxford: an actual MBA route still has eligibility conditions"}],[["$","p","Oxford’s MBA Weidenfeld-Hoffmann instructions provide a 6 January 2027 deadline. Pakistan’s presence on the university’s eligibility list is a starting point, not complete eligibility: residence, course, leadership and scholarship-statement requirements still matter.",{"children":"Oxford’s MBA Weidenfeld-Hoffmann instructions provide a 6 January 2027 deadline. Pakistan’s presence on the university’s eligibility list is a starting point, not complete eligibility: residence, course, leadership and scholarship-statement requirements still matter."}],["$","p","Check whether the MBA application and scholarship materials must be completed together and which admission round is required. Keep the official programme, award and country/residence evidence with the application record.",{"children":"Check whether the MBA application and scholarship materials must be completed together and which admission round is required. Keep the official programme, award and country/residence evidence with the application record."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.sbs.ox.ac.uk/oxford-experience/scholarships-and-funding/weidenfeld-hoffmann-scholarships-and-leadership-programme",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.sbs.ox.ac.uk/oxford-experience/scholarships-and-funding/weidenfeld-hoffmann-scholarships-and-leadership-programme","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Oxford MBA Weidenfeld-Hoffmann"}]]}],["$","span","https://www.ox.ac.uk/admissions/graduate/fees-and-funding/fees-funding-and-scholarshi